@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il30-nouns`

-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 88: the definitions of Part 5 (capital gains and losses), as far as ss 91,
-- 125B and 125C and the fixed/change-date layering of s 91(b1) need them.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt (sha256 b87f2cf4...6b81b6).
--
-- WHAT IT DOES. s 88 defines, for Part 5: a person's "means of control" in a body of persons and who is a "material
-- shareholder" (10% or more of any one kind, alone or together with another); who is a "relative"; what is an "asset";
-- the "original price" of an asset (six ways it can come to the taxpayer), the "purchase day", the "remaining original
-- price", "consideration", "capital gain" and "capital loss"; the "adjusted remaining original price", the "inflationary
-- amount" and the "real capital gain"; and the part of the real gain that accrued up to the fixed date (1 January 2003),
-- from the fixed date to the change date (1 January 2012), and after it.
--
-- NOT ENCODED, with the reason (NOTES.md coverage table): "sale" (the definition is open-ended: any act by which an
-- asset leaves one's hands; the caller says whether a sale occurred), "security" (a list of instruments; a caller
-- says what the instrument is), "future transaction", "oil and film partnership units", "exempt/liable mutual fund"
-- and "liable mutual fund" (the caller supplies which a fund is), "depreciable asset", "business inventory" (s 85),
-- the repealed definitions.
--
-- THE INDEX is the consumer price index last published before the day (s 88, "מדד" in the Ordinance). The three
-- readings the rules need are inputs, never supplied by this row.
--
-- FORKS (NOTES.md fork register): S1 (together with another), S2 (counting the days of a period), S3 (half the
-- holding expenses), S4 (the twelve months before a day). Each is a switch that defaults to declining where the
-- readings give different answers; where they agree the answer is given.

§ `Section 88 — definitions`

§§ `The fixed date and the change date`

-- src:3267 | ”מועד קובע“ – כ״ז בטבת התשס״ג (1 בינואר 2003);
-- src:3312 | ”מועד השינוי“ – יום ו׳ בטבת התשע״ב (1 בינואר 2012);
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88, "מועד קובע" and "מועד השינוי" (source lines 3267, 3312)
`s 88 — the fixed date` MEANS YMD 2003 1 1
`s 88 — the change date` MEANS YMD 2012 1 1

§§ `"Means of control" and "material shareholder"`

-- src:3249 | ”אמצעי שליטה“, בחבר־בני־אדם – כל אחת מאלה:
-- src:3250 | (1) הזכות לרווחים;
-- src:3251 | (2) הזכות למנות דירקטור או מנהל כללי בחברה, או בעלי תפקידים דומים בחבר־בני־אדם אחר;
-- src:3252 | (3) זכות הצבעה באסיפה כללית בחברה, או בגוף מקביל לה בחבר־בני־אדם אחר;
-- src:3253 | (4) הזכות לחלק ביתרת הנכסים לאחר סילוק החובות בעת פירוק;
-- src:3254 | (5) הזכות להורות למי שלו זכות מן הזכויות האמורות בפסקאות (1) עד (4) על הדרך להפעלת זכותו;
-- src:3255 | והכל, בין שהיא מכח מניות, זכויות למניות או זכויות אחרות, ובין בכל דרך אחרת, לרבות באמצעות הסכמי הצבעה או נאמנות;
-- src:3256 | ”בעל מניות מהותי“ – מי שמחזיק, במישרין או בעקיפין, לבדו או יחד עם אחר, ב־10% לפחות באחד או יותר מסוג כלשהו של אמצעי השליטה בחבר־בני־אדם;

-- The largest of the five fractions held: the test in the definition is "at least 10% in one or more of any kind".
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "אמצעי שליטה", "בעל מניות מהותי" (source lines 3249-3256)
GIVEN `the holdings` IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the largest fraction held of any one kind, in` `the holdings` MEANS
    maximum (LIST
        `the holdings`'s `fraction of the right to profits`,
        `the holdings`'s `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`,
        `the holdings`'s `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`,
        `the holdings`'s `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`,
        `the holdings`'s `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it`)

-- Two holdings added kind by kind: what a person holds together with another.
GIVEN a IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
      b IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
GIVETH A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
`the holdings` a `added to` b MEANS
    `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons` WITH
        `fraction of the right to profits`                                              IS a's `fraction of the right to profits` PLUS b's `fraction of the right to profits`
        `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`                IS a's `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager` PLUS b's `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`
        `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`                          IS a's `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting` PLUS b's `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`
        `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`          IS a's `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up` PLUS b's `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`
        `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` IS a's `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` PLUS b's `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it`

`nothing held` MEANS
    `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons` WITH
        `fraction of the right to profits`                                              IS 0
        `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`                IS 0
        `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`                          IS 0
        `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`          IS 0
        `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` IS 0

§§ `"Relative"`

-- src:3296 | ”קרוב“ – כל אחד מאלה:
-- src:3297 | (1) בן זוג, אח, אחות, הורה, הורה הורה, צאצא וצאצא של בן זוג, ובן זוגו של כל אחד מאלה;
-- src:3298 | (2) צאצא של אח או של אחות, ואח או אחות של הורה;
-- src:3299 | (3) חבר־בני־אדם שבהחזקת אדם או קרובו, אדם המחזיק בו וחבר־בני־אדם המוחזק בידי אדם המחזיק בו; לענין הגדרה זו, ”החזקה“ – במישרין או בעקיפין, לבד או יחד עם אחר, ב־25% לפחות באחד או יותר מסוג כלשהו של אמצעי השליטה;
-- src:3300 | (4) נאמן כהגדרתו בסעיף 75ג, לגבי היוצר בנאמנות תושבי ישראל או בנאמנות הדירה וכן נאמן לגבי נהנה בנאמנות נהנה תושב חוץ או בנאמנות לפי צוואה;
-- src:3301 | ואולם לענין פטור ממס לפי סעיף 97 יראו כקרוב רק את המנויים בפסקאות (1) ו־(2);

-- Paragraphs (1) and (2) are family ties; (3) is a tie of 25% holding; (4) is a trustee. "Holding" in (3) is 25% or more
-- of at least one kind of means of control, directly or indirectly, alone or together with another (the input already
-- gives the person's largest fraction, indirect included; together-with is not applied to the 25% test, see NOTES.md A3).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "קרוב" (source lines 3296-3300)
GIVEN `the tie` IS A `A tie between two persons, for the definition of "relative"`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — the tie makes a relative` `the tie` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the tie`
    WHEN `a tie of paragraph (1)` `the family tie`                                                        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a tie of paragraph (2)` `the family tie`                                                        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a body of persons held by the person or by a relative of the person` `the fraction`            THEN `the fraction` AT LEAST 25%
    WHEN `a person who holds the person` `the fraction`                                                  THEN `the fraction` AT LEAST 25%
    WHEN `a body of persons held by one who holds the person` `the fraction`                             THEN `the fraction` AT LEAST 25%
    WHEN `a trustee as paragraph (4) describes`                                                          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `no tie`                                                                                        THEN FALSE

-- "However, for exemption under s 97, only those in paragraphs (1) and (2) are regarded as relatives." (source line 3301)
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "קרוב", the proviso for s 97 (source line 3301)
GIVEN `the tie` IS A `A tie between two persons, for the definition of "relative"`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — the tie makes a relative, for the exemption in section 97` `the tie` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the tie`
    WHEN `a tie of paragraph (1)` `the family tie`                                                        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a tie of paragraph (2)` `the family tie`                                                        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a body of persons held by the person or by a relative of the person` `the fraction`            THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a person who holds the person` `the fraction`                                                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a body of persons held by one who holds the person` `the fraction`                             THEN FALSE
    WHEN `a trustee as paragraph (4) describes`                                                          THEN FALSE
    WHEN `no tie`                                                                                        THEN FALSE

§§ `"Together with another" and "material shareholder"`

-- src:3256 | ”בעל מניות מהותי“ – מי שמחזיק, במישרין או בעקיפין, לבדו או יחד עם אחר, ב־10% לפחות באחד או יותר מסוג כלשהו של אמצעי השליטה בחבר־בני־אדם;
-- src:3257 | ”יחד עם אחר“ – יחד עם קרובו, וכן יחד עם מי שאינו קרובו ויש ביניהם שיתוף פעולה דרך קבע על פי הסכם בענינים מהותיים של חבר־בני־האדם, במישרין או בעקיפין;

-- "Together with another": with a relative, and with a non-relative with whom there is regular cooperation under an agreement
-- on material matters of the body of persons (directly or indirectly).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "יחד עם אחר" (source line 3257)
GIVEN `the other` IS A `A person who may hold together with the person`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — the other holds together with the person` `the other` MEANS
        `s 88 — the tie makes a relative` (`the other`'s `tie to the person`)
     OR `the other`'s `regularly cooperates with the person by agreement on material matters of the body`

-- The others who count as "together with" the person.
GIVEN `the others` IS A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
`the others who hold together with the person, among` `the others` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN o YIELD `s 88 — the other holds together with the person` o) `the others`

-- The person's holdings with every one of those others added: "together with another", read as any number of others.
GIVEN `the person's own holdings` IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
      `the others`               IS A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — a material shareholder, together with any number of others` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others` MEANS
    `the largest fraction held of any one kind, in` `the person and every one of the others` AT LEAST 10%
    WHERE
        `the together-with` MEANS `the others who hold together with the person, among` `the others`
        `the person and every one of the others` MEANS
            `the holdings` `the person's own holdings` `added to`
                (`Holdings of means of control in one body of persons` WITH
                    `fraction of the right to profits`                                              IS sum (map (GIVEN o YIELD o's `holdings`'s `fraction of the right to profits`) `the together-with`)
                    `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`                IS sum (map (GIVEN o YIELD o's `holdings`'s `fraction of the right to appoint a director or general manager`) `the together-with`)
                    `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`                          IS sum (map (GIVEN o YIELD o's `holdings`'s `fraction of the voting rights in the general meeting`) `the together-with`)
                    `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`          IS sum (map (GIVEN o YIELD o's `holdings`'s `fraction of the right to a share of the surplus assets on winding up`) `the together-with`)
                    `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it` IS sum (map (GIVEN o YIELD o's `holdings`'s `fraction of the right to direct the holder of a right in (1) to (4) on how to use it`) `the together-with`))

-- The same, read as the person with one other only: alone, or with some single one of the others.
GIVEN `the person's own holdings` IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
      `the others`               IS A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — a material shareholder, together with one other person only` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others` MEANS
       `the largest fraction held of any one kind, in` `the person's own holdings` AT LEAST 10%
    OR any (GIVEN o YIELD `the largest fraction held of any one kind, in` (`the holdings` `the person's own holdings` `added to` (o's `holdings`)) AT LEAST 10%)
           (`the others who hold together with the person, among` `the others`)

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "בעל מניות מהותי", fork S1; Meng's ruling of 2026-10-08 (SHRUG)
GIVEN `the person's own holdings` IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
      `the others`               IS A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
      r                          IS A `A reading of "together with another"`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — a material shareholder` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others` `, reading together with another as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `together with any number of others, their holdings added`    THEN `many`
    WHEN `together with one other person only`                         THEN `one`
    WHEN `declined where the number of others changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `many` EQUALS `one`
           THEN `many`
           ELSE `section 88 says "together with another", and here one other person and several others give different answers`
    WHERE
        `many` MEANS `s 88 — a material shareholder, together with any number of others` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others`
        `one`  MEANS `s 88 — a material shareholder, together with one other person only` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 88 says "together with another", and here one other person and several others give different answers` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 88 says \"together with another\", and here one other person and several others give different answers"

-- The reading this row takes by default (Meng, SHRUG, 2026-10-08): declined where the readings part.
GIVETH A `A reading of "together with another"`
`s 88 — the default reading of "together with another"` MEANS
    `declined where the number of others changes the answer`

-- Material shareholder on the day, or on any recorded day from the first day of the twelve months before it.
-- The days recorded after the day are not looked at. A day on which nothing is recorded is not a day on which
-- the person was a material shareholder as far as this rule can tell (the caller records every day the status changed).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "בעל מניות מהותי"; s 91(b)(2) and s 125B(2), (3), (5) (the twelve months); fork S4
GIVEN `the first day`  IS A DATE
      `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the records`    IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
      r                IS A `A reading of "together with another"`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — a material shareholder on a recorded day from` `the first day` `up to` `the day` `, by the records` `the records` `, reading together with another as` r MEANS
    any (GIVEN h YIELD `s 88 — a material shareholder` (h's `the person's own holdings that day`) `with the others` (h's `the others who may hold together with the person that day`) `, reading together with another as` r)
        (filter (GIVEN h YIELD h's `the day` AT LEAST `the first day` AND h's `the day` AT MOST `the day`) `the records`)

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 88 does not say from which day the twelve months before a day run, and here the first day changes the answer` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 88 does not say from which day the twelve months before a day run, and here the first day changes the answer"

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "בעל מניות מהותי" read with s 91(b)(2), s 125B(2), (3), (5); forks S1, S4
GIVEN `the day`     IS A DATE
      `the records` IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
      r             IS A `The readings of the forks in sections 88, 91, 125B and 125C`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — a material shareholder on` `the day` `or at any time in the twelve months before it, by the records` `the records` `, reading the forks as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r's `the twelve months before a day`
    WHEN `the twelve months begin on the day twelve months before`                         THEN `from the day twelve months before`
    WHEN `the twelve months begin on the day after the day twelve months before`           THEN `from the day after`
    WHEN `declined where the first day of the twelve months changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `from the day twelve months before` EQUALS `from the day after`
           THEN `from the day twelve months before`
           ELSE `section 88 does not say from which day the twelve months before a day run, and here the first day changes the answer`
    WHERE
        `the day twelve months before` MEANS `add months` `the day` (0 MINUS 12)
        `from the day twelve months before` MEANS
            `s 88 — a material shareholder on a recorded day from` `the day twelve months before` `up to` `the day` `, by the records` `the records` `, reading together with another as` (r's `together with another`)
        `from the day after` MEANS
            `s 88 — a material shareholder on a recorded day from` (`the day twelve months before` PLUS 1) `up to` `the day` `, by the records` `the records` `, reading together with another as` (r's `together with another`)

§§ `"Asset"`

-- src:3258 | ”נכס“ – כל רכוש, בין מקרקעין ובין מטלטלין, וכן כל זכות או טובת הנאה ראויות או מוחזקות, והכל בין שהם בישראל ובין שהם מחוץ לישראל, למעט –
-- src:3259 | (1) מטלטלין של יחיד המוחזקים על ידיו לשימושו האישי או לשימושם האישי של בני־משפחתו או של בני־אדם התלויים בו;
-- src:3260 | (2) מלאי עסקי;
-- src:3261 | (3) זכות חזקה במקרקעין – בין שבדין ובין שביושר – המשמשים לצרכי מגורים ולא לשם השתכרות או ריווח;
-- src:3262 | (4) זכויות במקרקעין וזכויות באיגוד כהגדרתן בחוק מיסוי מקרקעין, שעל מכירתם מוטל מס שבח או שהיה עשוי להיות מוטל אילולא הפטור לפי החוק האמור;
-- The four exclusions. The caller says which apply to the thing sold.
DECLARE `What is sold` HAS
    `movables of an individual held for the personal use of the individual, family or dependants`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `business inventory`                                                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `a possessory right in land used for living and not for gain`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `a right in land or in a land association on whose sale betterment tax is imposed, or would be but for an exemption` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "נכס" (source lines 3258-3262)
GIVEN `the thing` IS A `What is sold`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 88 — the thing is an asset` `the thing` MEANS
    NOT (   `the thing`'s `movables of an individual held for the personal use of the individual, family or dependants`
         OR `the thing`'s `business inventory`
         OR `the thing`'s `a possessory right in land used for living and not for gain`
         OR `the thing`'s `a right in land or in a land association on whose sale betterment tax is imposed, or would be but for an exemption`)

§§ `"Original price" and "purchase day"`

-- src:3269 | ”מחיר מקורי“ –
-- src:3270 | (1) בנכס שנקנה – סכום שהוציא הנישום לרכישתו של אותו נכס;
-- src:3271 | (2) בנכס שנתקבל בחליפין – התמורה בעת החליפין;
-- src:3272 | (3) בנכס שנתקבל במתנה –
-- src:3273 | (א) לפני יום ד׳ בכסלו התשי״ב (3 בדצמבר 1951) – שווי הנכס בעת שנתקבל על ידי הנישום;
-- src:3274 | (ב) מיום ד׳ בכסלו התשי״ב (3 בדצמבר 1951) ועד יום ב׳ בניסן התשכ״ח (31 במרס 1968) – יתרת המחיר המקורי של הנכס בעת שניתן במתנה על ידי הרוכש האחרון שרכשו שלא במתנה; ולענין סעיף 21 יותר ניכוי הפחת כאילו לא ניתן הנכס במתנה;
-- src:3275 | (ג) מיום ג׳ בניסן התשכ״ח (1 באפריל 1968) ואילך –
-- src:3276 | (I) אם הנכס נתקבל במתנה שלא מקרוב – התמורה ביום המכירה; וסכום התמורה כאמור יהא המחיר המקורי גם לענין סעיף 21;
-- src:3277 | (II) אם הנכס נתקבל במתנה הפטורה ממס לפי סעיף 97(א)(4) או (5) – יתרת המחיר המקורי של הנכס בעת שניתן במתנה על ידי הרוכש האחרון שרכשו שלא במתנה פטורה ממס; ולענין סעיף 21 יותר ניכוי הפחת כאילו לא ניתן הנכס במתנה;
-- src:3278 | (4) בנכס שנתקבל בירושה – שווי הנכס ביום פטירת המוריש; נקבע שוויו של נכס לצורך מס עזבון כמשמעותו בחוק מס עזבון, תש״ט–1949, יהיה הוא השווי לענין זה; ואולם אם נפטר המוריש אחרי כ״ה באדר ב׳ התשמ״א (31 במרס 1981) – יהיה השווי השווי שהיה נקבע אילו מכר המוריש את הנכס; השווי כאמור יהא המחיר המקורי גם לענין סעיף 21;
-- src:3279 | (5) בנכס שיצר הנישום – הסכום שהוציא הנישום ליצירת הנכס;
-- src:3280 | (6) בנכס שהגיע אל הנישום בכל דרך אחרת – הסכום שהוציא הנישום לרכישתו של אותו נכס;
-- src:3281 | והכל בתוספת ההוצאות שהוציא הנישום להשבחת הנכס או להחזקתו מיום שרכשו ועד יום מכירתו, ובלבד שלא הותרו בניכוי בעבר בחישוב הכנסתו החייבת של הנישום (להלן – הוצאות השבחה או החזקה, לפי הענין);

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "מחיר מקורי", paragraphs (1) to (6) (source lines 3269-3280)
GIVEN `the way it came` IS A `How the asset came to the taxpayer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the original price, before the additions of the closing words,` `the way it came` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the way it came`
    WHEN `bought` x                                                                              THEN x
    WHEN `received in exchange` x                                                                THEN x
    WHEN `received as a gift before 3 December 1951` x                                           THEN x
    WHEN `received as a gift from 3 December 1951 to 31 March 1968` x                            THEN x
    WHEN `received as a gift from 1 April 1968, not from a relative` x                           THEN x
    WHEN `received as a gift from 1 April 1968 that is exempt under section 97(a)(4) or (5)` x   THEN x
    WHEN `received as a gift from 1 April 1968 from a relative, not exempt` x                    THEN x
    WHEN `inherited` x                                                                           THEN x
    WHEN `created by the taxpayer` x                                                             THEN x
    WHEN `arrived in some other way` x                                                           THEN x

-- "And all of it plus the expenses the taxpayer spent on improving or holding the asset from the day he acquired it to the
-- day he sold it, provided they were not deducted in the past in computing his taxable income."
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "מחיר מקורי", the closing words (source line 3281)
GIVEN `the way it came`                                  IS A `How the asset came to the taxpayer`
      `the improvement and holding expenses not deducted before` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the original price` `the way it came` `with the improvement and holding expenses not deducted before` `the improvement and holding expenses not deducted before` MEANS
    `s 88 — the original price, before the additions of the closing words,` `the way it came` PLUS `the improvement and holding expenses not deducted before`

-- src:3283 | ”יום הרכישה“ – היום שבו, בדרך כלשהי, הגיע הנכס לידי הנישום או שהנישום נעשה זכאי לו, לפי המוקדם; ואולם –
-- src:3284 | (1) אם הנכס הגיע לנישום או שהנישום נעשה זכאי לו, בדרך מתנה, לפני יום ג׳ בניסן התשכ״ח (1 באפריל 1968), או אף לאחר מכן אם הנכס הגיע לידי הנישום במתנה הפטורה ממס לפי סעיף 97(א)(4) או (5) – היום שבו הגיע הנכס לידי הרוכש האחרון שרכשו שלא במתנה פטורה ממס;
-- src:3285 | (2) אם הנכס הגיע לנישום בדרך ירושה ממוריש שנפטר אחרי כ״ה באדר ב׳ התשמ״א (31 במרס 1981) או בדרך ויתורו של אחר על זכותו לרשת ירושה ממוריש כאמור – היום שהיה נקבע כיום הרכישה אילו מכר המוריש את הנכס;
DECLARE `The facts that settle the purchase day` HAS
    `the day the asset reached the taxpayer`                                           IS A DATE
    `the day the taxpayer became entitled to it`                                       IS A DATE
    `a gift before 1 April 1968, or a gift exempt under section 97(a)(4) or (5) at any time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the day the asset reached the last acquirer other than by an exempt gift`         IS A MAYBE DATE
    `inherited from one who died after 31 March 1981, or by waiver of inheritance`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the day that would have been the purchase day had the decedent sold`              IS A MAYBE DATE

GIVETH A DATE
`the purchase day is not supplied` MEANS
    REFUSE "the day s 88 names as the purchase day was not supplied"

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "יום הרכישה" (source lines 3283-3285)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `The facts that settle the purchase day`
GIVETH A DATE
`s 88 — the purchase day` `the facts` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the facts`'s `a gift before 1 April 1968, or a gift exempt under section 97(a)(4) or (5) at any time`
            THEN CONSIDER `the facts`'s `the day the asset reached the last acquirer other than by an exempt gift`
                 WHEN JUST d THEN d
                 WHEN NOTHING THEN `the purchase day is not supplied`
        IF `the facts`'s `inherited from one who died after 31 March 1981, or by waiver of inheritance`
            THEN CONSIDER `the facts`'s `the day that would have been the purchase day had the decedent sold`
                 WHEN JUST d THEN d
                 WHEN NOTHING THEN `the purchase day is not supplied`
        OTHERWISE
            IF `the facts`'s `the day the asset reached the taxpayer` AT MOST `the facts`'s `the day the taxpayer became entitled to it`
            THEN `the facts`'s `the day the asset reached the taxpayer`
            ELSE `the facts`'s `the day the taxpayer became entitled to it`

§§ `"Consideration"`

-- src:3295 | ”תמורה“ – המחיר שיש לצפות לו ממכירת נכס על ידי מוכר מרצון לקונה מרצון כשהנכס נקי מכל שעבוד הבא להבטיח חוב, משכנתה, או זכות אחרת הבאה להבטיח תשלום; אולם אם פקיד השומה שוכנע, כי המחיר בעד הנכס נקבע בתום לב ובלי שהושפע, במישרין או בעקיפין, מקיום יחסים מיוחדים בין המוכר לקונה – ובמקרקעין גם בתנאי שהמכירה נעשתה בכתב – תהא התמורה המחיר שנקבע; והכל בניכוי הוצאות המכירה שהוציא הנישום באותה מכירה; בפדיון איגרת חוב או נייר ערך מסחרי, יראו את הפרשי ההצמדה כחלק מהתמורה;
DECLARE `The facts that settle the consideration` HAS
    `the price to be expected from a willing seller to a willing buyer, the asset free of any charge securing a debt` IS A NUMBER
    `the price agreed`                                                                   IS A NUMBER
    `the assessing officer is satisfied the agreed price was fixed in good faith, uninfluenced by special relations between seller and buyer` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a right in land`                                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the sale was made in writing`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the expenses of the sale the taxpayer incurred in that sale`                        IS A NUMBER
    `a bond or commercial security is redeemed`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the index differences on the redemption`                                            IS A NUMBER

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "תמורה" (source line 3295)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `The facts that settle the consideration`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the consideration` `the facts` MEANS
    `the price` MINUS `the facts`'s `the expenses of the sale the taxpayer incurred in that sale` PLUS `the index differences`
    WHERE
        `the agreed price counts` MEANS
                `the facts`'s `the assessing officer is satisfied the agreed price was fixed in good faith, uninfluenced by special relations between seller and buyer`
            AND ((NOT `the facts`'s `a right in land`) OR `the facts`'s `the sale was made in writing`)
        `the price` MEANS IF   `the agreed price counts`
                          THEN `the facts`'s `the price agreed`
                          ELSE `the facts`'s `the price to be expected from a willing seller to a willing buyer, the asset free of any charge securing a debt`
        `the index differences` MEANS IF   `the facts`'s `a bond or commercial security is redeemed`
                                      THEN `the facts`'s `the index differences on the redemption`
                                      ELSE 0

§§ `"Capital gain", "capital loss", "adjusted remaining original price", "inflationary amount" and "real capital gain"`

-- src:3288 | ”יתרת המחיר המקורי“ – המחיר המקורי של נכס לאחר שנוכו ממנו סכומי הפחת;
-- src:3289 | ”יתרת המחיר המקורי המתואם“ – יתרת המחיר המקורי למעט יתרת הוצאות ההשבחה ומחצית יתרת הוצאות ההחזקה, כפול במדד ביום המכירה ומחולק במדד ביום הרכישה ובתוספת יתרת הוצאות כל השבחה כפול במדד ביום המכירה ומחולק במדד ביום גמר ההשבחה;
-- src:3302 | ”ריווח הון“ – הסכום שבו עולה התמורה על יתרת המחיר המקורי;
-- src:3303 | ”סכום אינפלציוני“ –
-- src:3304 | (1) חלק ריווח ההון השווה לסכום שבו עולה יתרת המחיר המקורי המתואם על יתרת המחיר המקורי;
-- src:3310 | ”ריווח הון ריאלי“ – ריווח ההון פחות הסכום האינפלציוני;
-- src:3316 | ”הפסד הון“ – הסכום שבו עולה יתרת המחיר המקורי על התמורה;

-- "Capital gain": the amount by which the consideration exceeds the remaining original price. Where it does not, there is
-- no capital gain (and there may be a capital loss).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "ריווח הון" (source line 3302)
GIVEN `the sale` IS A `A sale of an asset`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the capital gain` `the sale` MEANS
    max 0 (`the sale`'s `consideration` MINUS `the sale`'s `remaining original price`)

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "הפסד הון" (source line 3316)
GIVEN `the sale` IS A `A sale of an asset`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the capital loss` `the sale` MEANS
    max 0 (`the sale`'s `remaining original price` MINUS `the sale`'s `consideration`)

-- The improvements' remaining expenses added up.
GIVEN `the improvements` IS A LIST OF `An improvement of the asset`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the remaining improvement expenses of` `the improvements` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN i YIELD i's `remaining expense of the improvement`) `the improvements`)

GIVETH A NUMBER
`section 88 leaves open what becomes of the half of the holding expenses that the adjusted price leaves out, and here it changes the answer` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 88 leaves open what becomes of the half of the holding expenses that the adjusted price leaves out, and here it changes the answer"

-- "Adjusted remaining original price": the remaining original price less the remaining improvement expenses and half the remaining
-- holding expenses, times the index on the sale day over the index on the purchase day; plus the remaining expense of each
-- improvement times the index on the sale day over the index on the day that improvement was finished. Fork S3: what becomes of the
-- half of the holding expenses that is left out.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "יתרת המחיר המקורי המתואם" (source line 3289); fork S3
GIVEN `the remaining original price`   IS A NUMBER
      `the improvements`               IS A LIST OF `An improvement of the asset`
      `the remaining holding expenses` IS A NUMBER
      `the index on the sale day`      IS A NUMBER
      `the index on the purchase day`  IS A NUMBER
      r                                IS A `A reading of half the holding expenses in the adjusted price`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the adjusted remaining original price of` `the remaining original price` `with the improvements` `the improvements` `and the holding expenses` `the remaining holding expenses` `at the index` `the index on the sale day` `over` `the index on the purchase day` `, reading half the holding expenses as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the half of the holding expenses that is left out is lost from the adjusted price`     THEN `lost`
    WHEN `the half of the holding expenses that is left out is added back, not indexed`          THEN `added back`
    WHEN `declined where half the holding expenses changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `the remaining holding expenses` EQUALS 0
           THEN `lost`
           ELSE `section 88 leaves open what becomes of the half of the holding expenses that the adjusted price leaves out, and here it changes the answer`
    WHERE
        `the part indexed from the purchase day` MEANS
            (   `the remaining original price`
          MINUS `the remaining improvement expenses of` `the improvements`
          MINUS `the remaining holding expenses` DIVIDED BY 2)
            TIMES `the index on the sale day` DIVIDED BY `the index on the purchase day`
        `the improvements, each indexed from its own day` MEANS
            sum (map (GIVEN i YIELD i's `remaining expense of the improvement` TIMES `the index on the sale day` DIVIDED BY i's `index on the day the improvement was finished`) `the improvements`)
        `lost`       MEANS `the part indexed from the purchase day` PLUS `the improvements, each indexed from its own day`
        `added back` MEANS `lost` PLUS `the remaining holding expenses` DIVIDED BY 2

-- "Inflationary amount": the part of the capital gain equal to the amount by which the adjusted remaining original price exceeds the
-- remaining original price. "Part of the capital gain" cannot exceed the capital gain (NOTES.md, assumption A4).
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "סכום אינפלציוני" (source lines 3303-3304); assumption A4
GIVEN `the sale` IS A `A sale of an asset`
      r          IS A `A reading of half the holding expenses in the adjusted price`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the inflationary amount of` `the sale` `, reading half the holding expenses as` r MEANS
    min (`s 88 — the capital gain` `the sale`) (max 0 (`the adjusted price` MINUS `the sale`'s `remaining original price`))
    WHERE
        `the adjusted price` MEANS
            `s 88 — the adjusted remaining original price of` (`the sale`'s `remaining original price`) `with the improvements` (`the sale`'s `improvements`) `and the holding expenses` (`the sale`'s `remaining holding expenses`) `at the index` (`the sale`'s `index on the sale day`) `over` (`the sale`'s `index on the purchase day`) `, reading half the holding expenses as` r

-- "Real capital gain": the capital gain less the inflationary amount.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "ריווח הון ריאלי" (source line 3310)
GIVEN `the sale` IS A `A sale of an asset`
      r          IS A `A reading of half the holding expenses in the adjusted price`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the real capital gain of` `the sale` `, reading half the holding expenses as` r MEANS
    `s 88 — the capital gain` `the sale` MINUS `s 88 — the inflationary amount of` `the sale` `, reading half the holding expenses as` r

§§ `"Chargeable inflationary amount"`

-- src:3307 | ”סכום אינפלציוני חייב“ – כל אחד מאלה:
-- src:3308 | (1) [note: (נמחקה);]
-- src:3309 | (2) הסכום שהיה נחשב כסכום האינפלציוני אילו נמכר הנכס ביום י״ז בטבת התשנ״ד (31 בדצמבר 1993) כשהתמורה היא יתרת המחיר המקורי המתואם;

-- The asset as it stood on 31 December 1993: the remaining price, the improvements already made, the holding expenses so far, and the two
-- indices. Section 88 takes the amount that "would be regarded as the inflationary amount had the asset been sold on 31 December 1993 with
-- the consideration the adjusted remaining original price". The consideration being the adjusted price itself, the gain is the adjusted
-- price less the remaining price, and the inflationary amount is that same difference.
DECLARE `The asset on 31 December 1993` HAS
    `remaining original price on 31 December 1993`   IS A NUMBER
    `improvements finished by 31 December 1993`      IS A LIST OF `An improvement of the asset`
    `remaining holding expenses on 31 December 1993` IS A NUMBER
    `index on 31 December 1993`                      IS A NUMBER
    `index on the purchase day`                      IS A NUMBER
    `purchase day`                                   IS A DATE

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "סכום אינפלציוני חייב" paragraph (2) (source line 3309); assumption A5
GIVEN `the asset` IS A `The asset on 31 December 1993`
      r           IS A `A reading of half the holding expenses in the adjusted price`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the chargeable inflationary amount of` `the asset` `, reading half the holding expenses as` r MEANS
    IF   `the asset`'s `purchase day` AT LEAST YMD 1994 1 1
    THEN 0
    ELSE max 0 (`the adjusted price` MINUS `the asset`'s `remaining original price on 31 December 1993`)
    WHERE
        `the adjusted price` MEANS
            `s 88 — the adjusted remaining original price of` (`the asset`'s `remaining original price on 31 December 1993`) `with the improvements` (`the asset`'s `improvements finished by 31 December 1993`) `and the holding expenses` (`the asset`'s `remaining holding expenses on 31 December 1993`) `at the index` (`the asset`'s `index on 31 December 1993`) `over` (`the asset`'s `index on the purchase day`) `, reading half the holding expenses as` r

§§ `The real capital gain up to the fixed date, from it to the change date, and the remainder`

-- src:3311 | ”רווח הון ריאלי עד המועד הקובע“ – רווח הון ריאלי, כשהוא מוכפל ביחס שבין התקופה שמיום הרכישה עד ליום שקדם למועד הקובע לבין התקופה שמיום הרכישה ועד ליום המכירה; שר האוצר רשאי לקבוע כללים לעיגול התקופות האמורות;
-- src:3313 | ”רווח הון ריאלי לאחר המועד הקובע ועד למועד השינוי“ – רווח הון ריאלי, כשהוא מוכפל ביחס שבין התקופה שמהמועד הקובע או מיום הרכישה, לפי המאוחר, עד ליום שקדם למועד השינוי, לבין התקופה שמיום הרכישה עד ליום המכירה; שר האוצר רשאי לקבוע כללים לעיגול התקופות האמורות;
-- src:3314 | ”יתרת רווח הון ריאלי לאחר מועד השינוי“ – ההפרש שבין רווח הון ריאלי לבין הסכום המתקבל מצירוף רווח הון ריאלי עד המועד הקובע ורווח הון ריאלי לאחר המועד הקובע ועד למועד השינוי;

GIVETH A NUMBER
`section 88 does not say how the days of a period are counted, and here the way of counting changes the answer` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 88 does not say how the days of a period are counted, and here the way of counting changes the answer"

-- The number of days "from A to B" under the reading of fork S2: counted at both ends, or the days between them.
-- The days of a period that ends before it starts are nought.
GIVEN a IS A DATE
      b IS A DATE
      r IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the days from` a `to` b `, reading the count as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `both the first and the last day are counted`                              THEN `both`
    WHEN `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`  THEN `between`
    WHEN `declined where the way of counting changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `the days from` a `to` b `, reading the count as` `both the first and the last day are counted` EQUALS `between`
           THEN `between`
           ELSE `section 88 does not say how the days of a period are counted, and here the way of counting changes the answer`
    WHERE
        `both`    MEANS max 0 ((b MINUS a) PLUS 1)
        `between` MEANS max 0 (b MINUS a)

GIVETH A NUMBER
`section 88 defines the real capital gain up to the fixed date for a sale on or after the fixed date` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 88 defines the real capital gain up to the fixed date for a sale on or after the fixed date"

GIVETH A NUMBER
`section 88 defines the parts of the real capital gain around the change date for a sale on or after the change date` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 88 defines the parts of the real capital gain around the change date for a sale on or after the change date"

-- Each of the three parts is computed at one counting of the days, and the public rule below compares the two countings
-- on the part asked for: where they give the same figure the figure is given, whatever the counting (the policy of
-- Meng's ruling of 2026-10-08, SHRUG: decline only where the readings part on the question asked).

-- "Real capital gain up to the fixed date": the real capital gain times the ratio of the period from the purchase day to the day
-- before the fixed date, to the period from the purchase day to the sale day. For a purchase on or after the fixed date the first
-- period is empty and the amount is nought.
GIVEN `the real capital gain` IS A NUMBER
      `the purchase day`      IS A DATE
      `the sale day`          IS A DATE
      c                       IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the real capital gain up to the fixed date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` c MEANS
    IF   `the sale day` LESS THAN `s 88 — the fixed date`
    THEN `section 88 defines the real capital gain up to the fixed date for a sale on or after the fixed date`
    ELSE `the real capital gain` TIMES `the days from` `the purchase day` `to` (`s 88 — the fixed date` MINUS 1) `, reading the count as` c
           DIVIDED BY `the days from` `the purchase day` `to` `the sale day` `, reading the count as` c

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "רווח הון ריאלי עד המועד הקובע" (source line 3311); fork S2
GIVEN `the real capital gain` IS A NUMBER
      `the purchase day`      IS A DATE
      `the sale day`          IS A DATE
      r                       IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the real capital gain up to the fixed date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, reading the count as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `both the first and the last day are counted`                              THEN `both`
    WHEN `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`  THEN `between`
    WHEN `declined where the way of counting changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `both` EQUALS `between`
           THEN `both`
           ELSE `section 88 does not say how the days of a period are counted, and here the way of counting changes the answer`
    WHERE
        `both`    MEANS `s 88 — the real capital gain up to the fixed date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` `both the first and the last day are counted`
        `between` MEANS `s 88 — the real capital gain up to the fixed date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`

-- "Real capital gain after the fixed date up to the change date": the real capital gain times the ratio of the period from the fixed
-- date or the purchase day, whichever is later, to the day before the change date, to the period from the purchase day to the sale day.
GIVEN `the real capital gain` IS A NUMBER
      `the purchase day`      IS A DATE
      `the sale day`          IS A DATE
      c                       IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the real capital gain after the fixed date up to the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` c MEANS
    IF   `the sale day` LESS THAN `s 88 — the change date`
    THEN `section 88 defines the parts of the real capital gain around the change date for a sale on or after the change date`
    ELSE `the real capital gain` TIMES `the days from` `the later of the fixed date and the purchase day` `to` (`s 88 — the change date` MINUS 1) `, reading the count as` c
           DIVIDED BY `the days from` `the purchase day` `to` `the sale day` `, reading the count as` c
    WHERE
        `the later of the fixed date and the purchase day` MEANS
            IF `the purchase day` AT LEAST `s 88 — the fixed date` THEN `the purchase day` ELSE `s 88 — the fixed date`

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "רווח הון ריאלי לאחר המועד הקובע ועד למועד השינוי" (source line 3313); fork S2
GIVEN `the real capital gain` IS A NUMBER
      `the purchase day`      IS A DATE
      `the sale day`          IS A DATE
      r                       IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the real capital gain after the fixed date up to the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, reading the count as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `both the first and the last day are counted`                              THEN `both`
    WHEN `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`  THEN `between`
    WHEN `declined where the way of counting changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `both` EQUALS `between`
           THEN `both`
           ELSE `section 88 does not say how the days of a period are counted, and here the way of counting changes the answer`
    WHERE
        `both`    MEANS `s 88 — the real capital gain after the fixed date up to the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` `both the first and the last day are counted`
        `between` MEANS `s 88 — the real capital gain after the fixed date up to the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`

-- "The remainder of the real capital gain after the change date": the real capital gain less the two parts above, at one counting.
GIVEN `the real capital gain` IS A NUMBER
      `the purchase day`      IS A DATE
      `the sale day`          IS A DATE
      c                       IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the remainder of the real capital gain after the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` c MEANS
    IF   `the sale day` LESS THAN `s 88 — the change date`
    THEN `section 88 defines the parts of the real capital gain around the change date for a sale on or after the change date`
    ELSE `the real capital gain`
      MINUS (`s 88 — the real capital gain up to the fixed date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` c
        PLUS `s 88 — the real capital gain after the fixed date up to the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` c)

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "יתרת רווח הון ריאלי לאחר מועד השינוי" (source line 3314); fork S2
GIVEN `the real capital gain` IS A NUMBER
      `the purchase day`      IS A DATE
      `the sale day`          IS A DATE
      r                       IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 88 — the remainder of the real capital gain after the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, reading the count as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `both the first and the last day are counted`                              THEN `both`
    WHEN `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`  THEN `between`
    WHEN `declined where the way of counting changes the answer`
      THEN IF   `both` EQUALS `between`
           THEN `both`
           ELSE `section 88 does not say how the days of a period are counted, and here the way of counting changes the answer`
    WHERE
        `both`    MEANS `s 88 — the remainder of the real capital gain after the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` `both the first and the last day are counted`
        `between` MEANS `s 88 — the remainder of the real capital gain after the change date, of` `the real capital gain` `bought on` `the purchase day` `and sold on` `the sale day` `, counting the days as` `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`

§§ `Whether the status is settled: the material shareholder as a MAYBE`

-- The rules of ss 91, 125B and 125C ask whether the seller or recipient was a material shareholder. Where forks S1 and S4 are left to
-- decline, the question is declined only if the answer turns on a reading. A rule that can still answer when the status does not
-- matter (the rate is the same either way) needs the status as a MAYBE: NOTHING means "the readings part". These rules give that.

-- The explicit readings of "together with another": the one named, or both where it is declined.
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of "together with another"`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reading of "together with another"`
`s 88 — the explicit readings of together with another in` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `together with any number of others, their holdings added`    THEN LIST `together with any number of others, their holdings added`
    WHEN `together with one other person only`                         THEN LIST `together with one other person only`
    WHEN `declined where the number of others changes the answer`      THEN LIST `together with any number of others, their holdings added`, `together with one other person only`

-- The explicit readings of the twelve months.
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of the twelve months before a day`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reading of the twelve months before a day`
`s 88 — the explicit readings of the twelve months in` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the twelve months begin on the day twelve months before`                         THEN LIST `the twelve months begin on the day twelve months before`
    WHEN `the twelve months begin on the day after the day twelve months before`           THEN LIST `the twelve months begin on the day after the day twelve months before`
    WHEN `declined where the first day of the twelve months changes the answer`
      THEN LIST `the twelve months begin on the day twelve months before`, `the twelve months begin on the day after the day twelve months before`

-- The common value of a list of booleans: JUST the value if they are all the same and there is at least one, NOTHING otherwise.
GIVEN xs IS A LIST OF BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the common truth value of` xs MEANS
    CONSIDER xs
    WHEN EMPTY                  THEN NOTHING
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest     THEN IF all (GIVEN y YIELD y EQUALS x) rest THEN JUST x ELSE NOTHING

-- Was the person a material shareholder on some recorded day from one of the candidate first days up to the day? JUST the answer where
-- every reading left open (fork S1, and each candidate first day) gives the same one; NOTHING where they part.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "בעל מניות מהותי"; forks S1, S4; Meng's ruling of 2026-10-08 (SHRUG)
GIVEN `the first days` IS A LIST OF DATE
      `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the records`    IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
      r                IS A `A reading of "together with another"`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 88 — whether a material shareholder on a recorded day from any of` `the first days` `up to` `the day` `, by the records` `the records` `, reading together with another as` r MEANS
    `the common truth value of`
        (concat (map (GIVEN t YIELD
                        map (GIVEN f YIELD
                                `s 88 — a material shareholder on a recorded day from` f `up to` `the day` `, by the records` `the records` `, reading together with another as` t)
                            `the first days`)
                    (`s 88 — the explicit readings of together with another in` r)))

-- The candidate first days of the twelve months before a day, one for each reading of fork S4 left open.
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      r         IS A `A reading of the twelve months before a day`
GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
`s 88 — the candidate first days of the twelve months before` `the day` `, reading them as` r MEANS
    map (GIVEN w YIELD
            CONSIDER w
            WHEN `the twelve months begin on the day twelve months before`                    THEN `add months` `the day` (0 MINUS 12)
            WHEN `the twelve months begin on the day after the day twelve months before`      THEN `add months` `the day` (0 MINUS 12) PLUS 1
            WHEN `declined where the first day of the twelve months changes the answer`       THEN `add months` `the day` (0 MINUS 12))
        (`s 88 — the explicit readings of the twelve months in` r)

-- Was the person a material shareholder on the day or at some time in the twelve months before it?
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 88 "בעל מניות מהותי" read with s 91(b)(2), s 125B(2), (5); forks S1, S4
GIVEN `the day`     IS A DATE
      `the records` IS A LIST OF `The holdings of a person on one day`
      r             IS A `The readings of the forks in sections 88, 91, 125B and 125C`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 88 — whether a material shareholder on` `the day` `or at any time in the twelve months before it, by the records` `the records` `, reading the forks as` r MEANS
    `s 88 — whether a material shareholder on a recorded day from any of` (`s 88 — the candidate first days of the twelve months before` `the day` `, reading them as` (r's `the twelve months before a day`)) `up to` `the day` `, by the records` `the records` `, reading together with another as` (r's `together with another`)

-- At one moment (a recorded snapshot of the holdings), the same.
GIVEN `the person's own holdings` IS A `Holdings of means of control in one body of persons`
      `the others`               IS A LIST OF `A person who may hold together with the person`
      r                          IS A `A reading of "together with another"`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 88 — whether a material shareholder, at one moment,` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others` `, reading together with another as` r MEANS
    `the common truth value of`
        (map (GIVEN t YIELD `s 88 — a material shareholder` `the person's own holdings` `with the others` `the others` `, reading together with another as` t)
             (`s 88 — the explicit readings of together with another in` r))

-- The explicit readings of how the days of a period are counted: the one named, or both where it is declined.
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A reading of how the days of a period are counted`
`s 88 — the explicit readings of the day count in` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `both the first and the last day are counted`                              THEN LIST `both the first and the last day are counted`
    WHEN `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`  THEN LIST `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`
    WHEN `declined where the way of counting changes the answer`
      THEN LIST `both the first and the last day are counted`, `the days between the first day and the last day, the first not counted`
